      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Alternatively, add \"invite photo\" and \"invite request photo\" as options in the Camera Mode section. Then we would be able to take an \"invite (request) photo\" without having to first open up the menu to send the invite (request).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
